New York Cool Climate Grape Ripening Repository
Data and software use terms

Copyright 2026 Jason Londo, Londo Lab, Cornell University (Cornell AgriTech).
All rights reserved.

These data are unpublished, pre-publication research data. They are made
available only for interactive viewing through the New York Cool Climate Grape
Ripening Repository web tool. The composition values are aggregated to the AVA
and region level and contain no individual vineyard identities.

PERMITTED
  Viewing and exploring the data through the web interface.

NOT PERMITTED without prior written permission from the Londo Lab
  Downloading, copying, re-hosting, or redistributing the data files.
  Use of the data, in whole or in part, in any publication, preprint,
  presentation, thesis, report, dataset, model, or other derived product.
  Commercial use of the data or the software.
  Reuse or redistribution of the software in this repository.

Using clearly marked pre-publication data without permission is a research
ethics violation.

To request permission or ask about use, contact the Londo Lab at
[CONTACT EMAIL to be added].

The absence of a technical download restriction does not grant permission to
use these data outside these terms. These terms may be updated.
